---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="LightSpeed Holdings — Build your AI company. Not just your chatbot."
  description="Light Speed Holdings turns a 19-file registry into a 144-agent org — with approvals, audit, memory & a live dashboard. From zero to ai-company dashboard in 45 seconds."
>
  <!-- HERO — Foaster-parity center + dual funnel (product + deploy) -->
  <section class="bg-[var(--ls-cream)] pt-[96px] md:pt-[120px] pb-[48px]">
    <div class="ls-inner text-center max-w-[880px]">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-white border border-[var(--ls-warm)] px-3 py-1 text-[0.78rem] text-[var(--ls-ink-muted)]">
        <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-500 animate-pulse" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        ruff ✅ mypy strict ✅ 1969 tests ✅ 78% coverage ✅ 20/20 GAPs
      </div>

      <h1 class="mt-6 font-semibold tracking-[-0.03em] text-[clamp(2.6rem,5.5vw,4.4rem)] leading-[1.08] fade-in">
        Build your AI company.<br />
        <span class="font-[var(--ls-font-serif)] font-normal italic">Not just your chatbot.</span>
      </h1>

      <p class="mx-auto mt-6 max-w-[52ch] text-[1.05rem] md:text-[1.15rem] leading-[1.7] text-[var(--ls-text-secondary)] fade-in">
        LightSpeed Holdings is a CLI that turns a 19-file registry into a <strong class="text-[var(--ls-ink)]">144-agent org</strong> — with 5-tier approvals, audit trail, memory & a live J.A.R.V.I.S. dashboard. From zero to <code class="px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-white border border-[var(--ls-warm)] rounded text-[0.9em] font-[var(--ls-font-mono)]">ai-company dashboard</code> in 45 seconds.
      </p>

      <!-- Dual CTA — Try product + Book deploy (Foaster single CTA fixed) -->
      <div class="mt-8 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-stretch sm:items-center justify-center gap-3 fade-in">
        <button
          id="copy-install"
          class="inline-flex items-center justify-between gap-3 rounded-full bg-[var(--ls-ink)] text-white px-6 py-3.5 font-mono text-[0.82rem] md:text-[0.88rem] hover:opacity-90 transition"
          data-track="click_hero_copy_install"
          aria-label="Copy install command"
        >
          <span class="hidden sm:inline opacity-70">$</span><span id="install-cmd">uv sync && ai-company company run</span>
          <span class="ml-2 inline-flex items-center rounded-full bg-white/15 px-2.5 py-1 text-[0.72rem]">⧉ Copy</span>
        </button>
        <a href="#workflow" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-[var(--ls-ink)] px-6 py-3.5 text-[0.92rem] font-medium hover:bg-[var(--ls-ink)] hover:text-white transition">
          Explore the system →
        </a>
      </div>
      <div class="mt-3 flex items-center justify-center gap-2 text-[0.82rem] text-[var(--ls-ink-muted)]">
        <a href="/contact" class="underline decoration-[var(--ls-warm)] underline-offset-4 hover:text-[var(--ls-ink)]" data-track="click_hero_book_deploy">Book deployment</a>
        <span aria-hidden="true">·</span>
        <a href="https://github.com/jmlusu/light-speed-holdings" class="hover:text-[var(--ls-ink)]">View on GitHub ↗</a>
        <span aria-hidden="true">·</span>
        <a href="/docs" class="hover:text-[var(--ls-ink)]">Docs</a>
      </div>

      <!-- Hero artifact — Foaster video card → LightSpeed terminal + Company Core SVG -->
      <div class="mt-10 rounded-[24px] md:rounded-[24px] overflow-hidden bg-white border border-[var(--ls-warm)] shadow-[var(--ls-shadow-video)] text-left max-w-[960px] mx-auto">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-3 border-b border-[var(--ls-divider)] bg-[var(--ls-pearl)]">
          <span class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-red-400"></span>
          <span class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-yellow-400"></span>
          <span class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-emerald-400"></span>
          <span class="ml-3 font-[var(--ls-font-mono)] text-[0.78rem] text-[var(--ls-ink-muted)]">ai-company · zsh</span>
          <span class="ml-auto text-[0.72rem] text-[var(--ls-ink-muted)] hidden sm:inline">144 agents · 20 departments · 30+ commands</span>
        </div>
        <pre class="p-5 md:p-6 font-[var(--ls-font-mono)] text-[0.78rem] md:text-[0.84rem] leading-[1.7] overflow-auto text-[var(--ls-ink)]"><code><span class="text-[var(--ls-ink-muted)]">$</span> ai-company --help
  <span class="text-[var(--ls-accent)]">generate</span>     Render .opencode/agents/*.md from registry
  <span class="text-[var(--ls-accent)]">company run</span>  Bootstrap 24 dirs + 144 agents + configs
  <span class="text-[var(--ls-accent)]">dashboard</span>    CEO Control Plane on :8420 (J.A.R.V.I.S.)
  <span class="text-[var(--ls-accent)]">doctor</span>       Health + deployment checks
  <span class="text-[var(--ls-accent)]">workflows</span>    9 DAGs · SLA monitoring
<span class="text-[var(--ls-ink-muted)]">$</span> uv sync && ai-company company run
  <span class="text-emerald-600">✔ 144 agents generated</span>  <span class="text-[var(--ls-ink-muted)]">registry/loader → Jinja2 → .opencode/agents</span>
  <span class="text-emerald-600">✔ dashboard live</span>    <span class="text-[var(--ls-ink-muted)]">http://127.0.0.1:8420</span>
<span class="text-[var(--ls-ink-muted)]">$</span> ai-company agents list | head
  <span class="text-[var(--ls-ink-muted)]">chief-of-staff · cto · vp-engineering · cpo · cmo · cso · … (144)</span></code></pre>
        <div class="px-5 py-3 bg-[var(--ls-ink)] text-white flex items-center justify-between text-[0.78rem]">
          <span class="font-mono opacity-80">Company Core — 4 graphs · BFS pathfinding · 6 memory types</span>
          <a href="/platform" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded-full bg-white text-[var(--ls-ink)] px-3 py-1 font-medium">Explore graph →</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- STATS band — Foaster 95%/39%/42% pattern → LightSpeed verifiable telemetry -->
  <section class="bg-white border-y border-[var(--ls-divider)]">
    <div class="ls-inner grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 py-8 md:py-10 text-center">
      <div>
        <div class="font-semibold tracking-[-0.02em] text-[clamp(2rem,4vw,2.8rem)]">144</div>
        <div class="text-[0.88rem] text-[var(--ls-text-secondary)]">agents across 20 departments</div>
        <div class="text-[0.72rem] uppercase tracking-wide text-[var(--ls-ink-muted)] mt-1">company-registry.yaml → generator (12 Jinja2)</div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div class="font-semibold tracking-[-0.02em] text-[clamp(2rem,4vw,2.8rem)]">20/20</div>
        <div class="text-[0.88rem] text-[var(--ls-text-secondary)]">GAPs resolved · 1969 tests green</div>
        <div class="text-[0.72rem] uppercase tracking-wide text-[var(--ls-ink-muted)] mt-1">ruff · mypy strict · 78% coverage</div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div class="font-semibold tracking-[-0.02em] text-[clamp(2rem,4vw,2.8rem)]">5-tier</div>
        <div class="text-[0.88rem] text-[var(--ls-text-secondary)]">approvals · audit JSONL · memory 6 types</div>
        <div class="text-[0.72rem] uppercase tracking-wide text-[var(--ls-ink-muted)] mt-1">DecisionEngine · GraphEngine BFS · WorkflowEngine</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- METHOD — Foaster Our Method 4-card → LightSpeed 4 (adapted) -->
  <section id="workflow" class="bg-[var(--ls-sage)] py-[80px] md:py-[100px]">
    <div class="ls-shell">
      <div class="max-w-[720px] mx-auto text-center">
        <div class="text-[0.78rem] uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-[var(--ls-ink-muted)]">Our Method</div>
        <h2 class="mt-3 font-semibold tracking-[-0.02em] text-[clamp(1.9rem,4vw,2.8rem)]">From YAML to org in 45 seconds</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 text-[var(--ls-text-secondary)]">Foaster maps how work happens with interviews. We generate it — then orchestrate, execute, and learn.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-10 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-3 md:gap-4">
        <a href="/how-it-works#define" class="group bg-white rounded-[6px] overflow-hidden border border-[var(--ls-card-border)] hover:border-[var(--ls-warm)] transition">
          <div class="aspect-[0.9/1] bg-gradient-to-br from-[var(--ls-cream)] to-white p-6 flex flex-col">
            <div class="text-[0.72rem] uppercase tracking-wide text-[var(--ls-ink-muted)]">01 · Define</div>
            <div class="mt-auto w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-[var(--ls-ink)] text-white grid place-items-center text-[1.1rem]">◈</div>
            <div class="mt-4 font-[var(--ls-font-mono)] text-[0.76rem] text-[var(--ls-ink-muted)]">company-registry.yaml<br/>19 YAML configs · 20 depts</div>
          </div>
          <div class="p-4">
            <div class="font-semibold">Define the registry</div>
            <div class="text-[0.88rem] text-[var(--ls-text-secondary)] mt-1">Single source of truth — agents, tools, permissions, models.</div>
          </div>
        </a>

        <a href="/how-it-works#generate" class="group bg-white rounded-[6px] overflow-hidden border border-[var(--ls-card-border)]">
          <div class="aspect-[0.9/1] bg-gradient-to-br from-white to-[var(--ls-pearl)] p-6 flex flex-col">
            <div class="text-[0.72rem] uppercase tracking-wide text-[var(--ls-ink-muted)]">02 · Generate</div>
            <div class="mt-auto w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-[var(--ls-accent)] text-white grid place-items-center">⚡</div>
            <div class="mt-4 font-[var(--ls-font-mono)] text-[0.76rem] text-[var(--ls-ink-muted)]">python -c &quot;Generator().generate_all()&quot;<br/>12 Jinja2 → .opencode/agents/*.md</div>
          </div>
          <div class="p-4">
            <div class="font-semibold">Generate 144 agents</div>
            <div class="text-[0.88rem] text-[var(--ls-text-secondary)] mt-1">Deterministic, CWD-independent, typed via Pydantic.</div>
          </div>
        </a>

        <a href="/how-it-works#orchestrate" class="group bg-white rounded-[6px] overflow-hidden border border-[var(--ls-card-border)]">
          <div class="aspect-[0.9/1] bg-gradient-to-br from-[var(--ls-pearl)] to-white p-6 flex flex-col">
            <div class="text-[0.72rem] uppercase tracking-wide text-[var(--ls-ink-muted)]">03 · Orchestrate</div>
            <div class="mt-auto w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-[var(--ls-accent-2)] text-white grid place-items-center">◍</div>
            <div class="mt-4 font-[var(--ls-font-mono)] text-[0.76rem] text-[var(--ls-ink-muted)]">MessageBus tick<br/>JSON queue @ .opencode/inbox.json</div>
          </div>
          <div class="p-4">
            <div class="font-semibold">Orchestrate with governance</div>
            <div class="text-[0.88rem] text-[var(--ls-text-secondary)] mt-1">5-tier approvals, HITL expiry sweep, lease locking.</div>
          </div>
        </a>

        <a href="/how-it-works#execute" class="group bg-white rounded-[6px] overflow-hidden border border-[var(--ls-card-border)]">
          <div class="aspect-[0.9/1] bg-gradient-to-br from-white to-[var(--ls-sage)] p-6 flex flex-col">
            <div class="text-[0.72rem] uppercase tracking-wide text-[var(--ls-ink-muted)]">04 · Execute & Learn</div>
            <div class="mt-auto w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-[var(--ls-ink)] text-white grid place-items-center">↗</div>
            <div class="mt-4 font-[var(--ls-font-mono)] text-[0.76rem] text-[var(--ls-ink-muted)]">AgentLoop → ToolRunner → Memory<br/>6 types · 4 graphs BFS · postmortem</div>
          </div>
          <div class="p-4">
            <div class="font-semibold">Execute & compound</div>
            <div class="text-[0.88rem] text-[var(--ls-text-secondary)] mt-1">ReAct loops, cost-tracked, auditable, consolidating.</div>
          </div>
        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-6 text-center">
        <a href="/how-it-works" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-[0.92rem] font-medium underline decoration-[var(--ls-warm)] underline-offset-4" data-track="click_method_learn">Learn more about the method →</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CLARITY — Foaster quote → LightSpeed -->
  <section class="bg-[var(--ls-pearl)] py-[64px] md:py-[88px]">
    <div class="ls-inner max-w-[880px] text-center">
      <blockquote class="font-semibold tracking-[-0.04em] text-[clamp(1.9rem,5vw,2.9rem)] leading-[1.15]">
        AI transformation starts when the company can finally see — and <span class="font-[var(--ls-font-serif)] italic font-normal">generate</span> — itself.
      </blockquote>
      <p class="mt-4 text-[var(--ls-text-secondary)]">One registry, 144 agents, one command. No decks.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- SOLUTIONS — Foaster 3-card (Assessment/Continuous/Enterprise) → LightSpeed tiers -->
  <section class="bg-white py-[72px] md:py-[88px]">
    <div class="ls-shell">
      <div class="flex items-end justify-between gap-6 flex-wrap">
        <div>
          <div class="text-[0.78rem] uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-[var(--ls-ink-muted)]">Offered as</div>
          <h2 class="mt-2 font-semibold tracking-[-0.02em] text-[clamp(1.8rem,4vw,2.4rem)]">Self-serve, managed, or deployed</h2>
        </div>
        <a href="/solutions" class="text-[0.9rem] font-medium underline decoration-[var(--ls-warm)] underline-offset-4">View all solutions →</a>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-8 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-5">
        <a href="/solutions/assessment" class="group rounded-[12px] border border-[var(--ls-card-border)] overflow-hidden hover:shadow-[var(--ls-shadow-card)] transition bg-white">
          <div class="aspect-[1/0.9] bg-gradient-to-br from-[var(--ls-cream)] to-white p-6 flex flex-col justify-end">
            <div class="text-[0.72rem] uppercase tracking-wide text-[var(--ls-ink-muted)]">For teams starting</div>
            <div class="mt-2 text-[1.05rem] font-semibold">AI Company Assessment</div>
            <div class="text-[0.84rem] text-[var(--ls-text-secondary)]">10-day diagnostic → map + leverage points</div>
          </div>
          <div class="p-5">
            <div class="text-[0.88rem] text-[var(--ls-text-secondary)]">We run the registry over your org → 1,200+ processes mapped, 3-7 leverage points, 9 workflow DAGs.</div>
            <div class="mt-3 inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-[0.88rem] font-medium group-hover:gap-1.5 transition-all">Learn more <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></div>
          </div>
        </a>

        <a href="/solutions/managed-platform" class="group rounded-[12px] border border-[var(--ls-card-border)] overflow-hidden hover:shadow-[var(--ls-shadow-card)] transition bg-white">
          <div class="aspect-[1/0.9] bg-gradient-to-br from-[var(--ls-sage)] to-white p-6 flex flex-col justify-end">
            <div class="text-[0.72rem] uppercase tracking-wide text-[var(--ls-ink-muted)]">For teams scaling</div>
            <div class="mt-2 text-[1.05rem] font-semibold">Managed Platform</div>
            <div class="text-[0.84rem] text-[var(--ls-text-secondary)]">Daemon + governance sweeps + KPIs</div>
          </div>
          <div class="p-5">
            <div class="text-[0.88rem] text-[var(--ls-text-secondary)]">We operate the daemon: KPI snapshots, HITL expiry, retention — you ship via inbox.json.</div>
            <div class="mt-3 inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-[0.88rem] font-medium group-hover:gap-1.5 transition-all">Learn more <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></div>
          </div>
        </a>

        <a href="/solutions/enterprise" class="group rounded-[12px] border border-[var(--ls-card-border)] overflow-hidden hover:shadow-[var(--ls-shadow-card)] transition bg-white">
          <div class="aspect-[1/0.9] bg-gradient-to-br from-[var(--ls-pearl)] to-white p-6 flex flex-col justify-end">
            <div class="text-[0.72rem] uppercase tracking-wide text-[var(--ls-ink-muted)]">For teams embedding</div>
            <div class="mt-2 text-[1.05rem] font-semibold">Enterprise Deployment</div>
            <div class="text-[0.84rem] text-[var(--ls-text-secondary)]">FDEs build agents & SOPs in your stack</div>
          </div>
          <div class="p-5">
            <div class="text-[0.88rem] text-[var(--ls-text-secondary)]">Forward-deployed engineers integrate with ERP/CRM, custom RAG, VPC, private LLM.</div>
            <div class="mt-3 inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-[0.88rem] font-medium group-hover:gap-1.5 transition-all">Learn more <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></div>
          </div>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- PROOF — Foaster case study 350/280/1200 → LightSpeed dogfood -->
  <section class="bg-[var(--ls-cream)] border-y border-[var(--ls-divider)] py-12 md:py-16">
    <div class="ls-shell grid lg:grid-cols-[1.2fr_.8fr] gap-8 items-center">
      <div>
        <div class="text-[0.78rem] uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-[var(--ls-ink-muted)]">Dogfood case</div>
        <h2 class="mt-2 font-semibold tracking-[-0.02em] text-[clamp(1.6rem,4vw,2.2rem)]">We run LightSpeed on LightSpeed — 144 agents, 0 deck</h2>
        <ul class="mt-5 grid grid-cols-3 gap-4 text-center">
          <li class="rounded-[12px] bg-white border border-[var(--ls-card-border)] p-4"><div class="text-[1.6rem] font-semibold">1969</div><div class="text-[0.72rem] uppercase tracking-wide text-[var(--ls-ink-muted)]">tests passing</div></li>
          <li class="rounded-[12px] bg-white border border-[var(--ls-card-border)] p-4"><div class="text-[1.6rem] font-semibold">45s</div><div class="text-[0.72rem] uppercase tracking-wide text-[var(--ls-ink-muted)]">to 144 agents</div></li>
          <li class="rounded-[12px] bg-white border border-[var(--ls-card-border)] p-4"><div class="text-[1.6rem] font-semibold">30</div><div class="text-[0.72rem] uppercase tracking-wide text-[var(--ls-ink-muted)]">CLI commands</div></li>
        </ul>
        <p class="mt-5 text-[0.95rem] text-[var(--ls-text-secondary)]">Architecture receipts: <code class="font-[var(--ls-font-mono)] text-[0.82rem]">registry/loader.py</code> + <code class="font-[var(--ls-font-mono)] text-[0.82rem]">12 Jinja2 templates</code> + <code class="font-[var(--ls-font-mono)] text-[0.82rem]">17 Pydantic models</code> + audited CI <code class="font-[var(--ls-font-mono)] text-[0.82rem]">32907261730</code> green.</p>
        <a href="/case-study" class="mt-4 inline-flex text-[0.9rem] font-medium underline decoration-[var(--ls-warm)] underline-offset-4">Read the 9-day-style case study →</a>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-[20px] bg-white border border-[var(--ls-card-border)] p-6 shadow-[var(--ls-shadow-card)]">
        <div class="text-[0.78rem] uppercase tracking-wide text-[var(--ls-ink-muted)]">Operational map — Company Core</div>
        <div class="mt-3 aspect-[4/3] rounded-[12px] bg-[var(--ls-pearl)] border border-[var(--ls-divider)] grid place-items-center text-[0.82rem] text-[var(--ls-ink-muted)]">
          <span class="font-[var(--ls-font-mono)]">GraphEngine BFS preview — org_chart → workflow_graph<br/>Query: CTO → memory_owner (3 hops)</span>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-4 flex gap-2">
          <a href="/graph-demo" class="flex-1 text-center rounded-full border border-[var(--ls-ink)] py-2 text-[0.84rem] font-medium">Try graph query</a>
          <a href="/docs" class="flex-1 text-center rounded-full bg-[var(--ls-ink)] text-white py-2 text-[0.84rem] font-medium">Docs</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- FAQ — Foaster glass + <details> -->
  <section class="bg-[var(--ls-pearl)] py-[56px] md:py-[72px]">
    <div class="ls-shell max-w-[900px]">
      <h2 class="text-center font-semibold tracking-[-0.02em] text-[clamp(1.8rem,4vw,2.5rem)]">FAQ</h2>
      <div class="mt-8 rounded-[32px] bg-white/60 backdrop-blur-[20px] border border-white/50 shadow-[var(--ls-shadow-faq)] p-4 md:p-8" style="border-radius: 32px;">
        <div class="space-y-2" id="faq">
          <details class="group bg-white rounded-[14px] border border-[var(--ls-card-border)] p-4" data-track="faq_click">
            <summary class="list-none flex items-center justify-between gap-4 cursor-pointer font-medium">How is this different from consulting?<span class="shrink-0 w-7 h-7 grid place-items-center rounded-full border border-[var(--ls-warm)] group-open:rotate-45 transition">+</span></summary>
            <p class="mt-3 text-[0.92rem] text-[var(--ls-text-secondary)]">Consultants give you a deck. LightSpeed gives you a company: 144 agents, governed queue, memory, audit, dashboard — generated in 45s, not 12 weeks.</p>
          </details>
          <details class="group bg-white rounded-[14px] border border-[var(--ls-card-border)] p-4" data-track="faq_click">
            <summary class="list-none flex items-center justify-between gap-4 cursor-pointer font-medium">How fast is the assessment?<span class="shrink-0 w-7 h-7 grid place-items-center rounded-full border border-[var(--ls-warm)] group-open:rotate-45 transition">+</span></summary>
            <p class="mt-3 text-[0.92rem] text-[var(--ls-text-secondary)]"><code>ai-company company run</code> in 45s, dashboard live, first workflow dispatched on next <code>tick</code> (&lt;2 min). For human transformation, the 10-day Assessment packages via Offer E.</p>
          </details>
          <details class="group bg-white rounded-[14px] border border-[var(--ls-card-border)] p-4" data-track="faq_click">
            <summary class="list-none flex items-center justify-between gap-4 cursor-pointer font-medium">Is this adapted to company size?<span class="shrink-0 w-7 h-7 grid place-items-center rounded-full border border-[var(--ls-warm)] group-open:rotate-45 transition">+</span></summary>
            <p class="mt-3 text-[0.92rem] text-[var(--ls-text-secondary)]">50-person → Growth (Offer A). 5k+ → Enterprise with FDEs. Same registry, different <code>company/config/kpis.yaml</code> + routing tiers.</p>
          </details>
          <details class="group bg-white rounded-[14px] border border-[var(--ls-card-border)] p-4" data-track="faq_click">
            <summary class="list-none flex items-center justify-between gap-4 cursor-pointer font-medium">How much does it cost?<span class="shrink-0 w-7 h-7 grid place-items-center rounded-full border border-[var(--ls-warm)] group-open:rotate-45 transition">+</span></summary>
            <p class="mt-3 text-[0.92rem] text-[var(--ls-text-secondary)]">Self-serve CLI is free — pay only inference (tracked per task in <code>cost_log.jsonl</code>, budget-capped). Managed Platform scoped to registry size &amp; keys (Ollama vs API). No &quot;3-5× cheaper&quot; hand-waving — your CFO audits the log. See <a href="/pricing" class="underline">Pricing</a>.</p>
          </details>
          <details class="group bg-white rounded-[14px] border border-[var(--ls-card-border)] p-4" data-track="faq_click">
            <summary class="list-none flex items-center justify-between gap-4 cursor-pointer font-medium">Data security?<span class="shrink-0 w-7 h-7 grid place-items-center rounded-full border border-[var(--ls-warm)] group-open:rotate-45 transition">+</span></summary>
            <p class="mt-3 text-[0.92rem] text-[var(--ls-text-secondary)]">FileStore locking, API-key RBAC (<code>rbac.py</code>), CORS allowlist, audit JSONL append-only, cost budgets, fail-closed gates. See <a href="/security" class="underline">/security</a> + ADR-012.</p>
          </details>
          <details class="group bg-white rounded-[14px] border border-[var(--ls-card-border)] p-4" data-track="faq_click">
            <summary class="list-none flex items-center justify-between gap-4 cursor-pointer font-medium">Do we need to book a call to evaluate?<span class="shrink-0 w-7 h-7 grid place-items-center rounded-full border border-[var(--ls-warm)] group-open:rotate-45 transition">+</span></summary>
            <p class="mt-3 text-[0.92rem] text-[var(--ls-text-secondary)]">No — Foaster forces a call, we keep dual funnel: copy the install, run locally, read <a href="/docs" class="underline">docs</a>. Book deployment only if you want FDEs.</p>
          </details>
        </div>
      </div>
      <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify({
